{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2023-01-24 07:30:00', 'title': 'DILIGEND REBRANDS AS DASSETI, ANNOUNCES SERIES A FINANCING LED BY NASDAQ VENTURES', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--DILIGEND, THE AWARD-WINNING DIGITAL DUE DILIGENCE SOFTWARE COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE REBRAND OF ITS COMPANY, NOW TO BE KNOWN AS DASSETI. THE REBRAND COMES ALONGSIDE THE SUCCESSFUL CLOSE OF ITS SERIES A FINANCING LED BY NASDAQ VENTURES.'}